  (text "BT1: Tenergy 7.4 V 2200 mAh 2S1P Li-ion with protection PCB (31003 assumed: 3 A\ncontinuous, 1 A max charge); 8.4 V full, 6.8 V firmware cutoff. Confirm label and connector.\nF1: 5 A blade fuse in a holder on the battery + lead (provisional); protects the wiring, the pack\nPCB is the cell protection.  SW1: SPST >= 5 A DC, load side only; the charger stays on the pack side." (at 15.24 66.04 0)
