  (text "C1 1000 uF / 16 V (+ to V+) and C2 100 nF sit at the servo connector.\nJ2 (MG996R lead): pin 1 GND (brown), pin 2 V+ (red), pin 3 signal (orange); check your lead.\nSignal is 3.3 V PWM from D0 / GPIO1 into a 6 V servo (no buffer, as the firmware assumes)." (at 172.72 120.65 0)
