  (text "C3 100 nF at the XIAO 5V pad.\nPWR_FLAG: 5 V reaches the pad through\nD1 (or from USB-C when programming)." (at 194.31 207 0)
    (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left top))
    (uuid 9af565ad-5d27-5d4f-a719-3b9148ade5fa)
  )
  (rectangle (start 111.76 233) (end 222.25 250)
    (stroke (width 0.254) (type dash))
    (fill (type none))
    (uuid e38766d8-7123-57e2-8fc7-cb19abbf4845)
  )
  (text "SENSE CAMERA BOARD (note only, not wired here)\nThe Sense camera board is attached to the XIAO ESP32-S3 by its factory B2B connector;\nno header pin is used for it. BAT pads on the underside of the XIAO are unused.\nUSB-C on the XIAO is for programming (5V pad is fed from D1; never from the 6 V rail)." (at 113.03 234.3 0)
    (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left top))
    (uuid 4b5fc9a0-f729-5fdd-949c-c5d7cebf655d)
  )
  (text "UNCONNECTED (per spec): XIAO D1, D3-D10, 3V3 (no-connect flags), BAT pads;\nU1 / U2 have no enable pins on these symbols; U4 USB-C input is the external adapter." (at 15.24 238.76 0)
    (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left top))
    (uuid c725f671-c776-5b44-a47e-c4e2aba0ebdb)
  )
  (text "D31 AND AUTHORITY" (at 304.8 17.78 0)
    (effects (font (size 1.8 1.8) bold) (justify left top))
    (uuid 170e7d7f-0067-5ae7-8888-3c86f3e069bf)
  )
  (text "DECISIONS.md D31 (2026-10-21): Tenergy 7.4 V 2S pack; ZTW UBEC at 6.0 V for the servo;\n    MP1584 at 5.00 V for the XIAO through a 1N5819, never from the 6 V rail; USB-C 2S\n    charger on the pack side of the main switch.\nSpec: docs/electrical/claw_revB_20261021/CLAW_REVB_SPEC.md. Pin map:\n    firmware/claw_s3/claw_s3.ino (servo PWM D0 / GPIO1; battery sense D2 / GPIO3,\n    BATT_RATIO 3.0, cutoff 6.8 V)." (at 304.8 22.98 0)
    (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left top))
    (uuid 0e12d6c7-4b89-5085-b983-93c6432c0db0)
  )
  (text "CHARGING RULE (D31)" (at 304.8 40.88 0)
    (effects (font (size 1.8 1.8) bold) (justify left top))
    (uuid 78c7a5e5-b787-5ee8-b655-a8af056a2908)
  )
  (text "CHARGE ONLY WITH SW1 OFF, attended, on a non-flammable surface, with an 8.4 V CC/CV\n    charger at <= 1 A.\nThe pack's protection PCB must provide per-cell overcharge / over-discharge protection:\n    confirm it on the label or datasheet before the first charge (a 2-wire pack cannot be\n    balance-charged)." (at 304.8 46.08 0)
    (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left top))
    (uuid d81938f6-9eec-5e64-931b-fb0c8de67016)
  )
  (text "EMERGENCY STOP" (at 304.8 61.83 0)
    (effects (font (size 1.8 1.8) bold) (justify left top))
    (uuid 2992ab61-6ed0-5fd6-8e53-11e40229c999)
  )
  (text "The emergency stop is the switched power strip at the stations. SW1 on the claw is a\n    SERVICE DISCONNECT only; it does not stop the winches." (at 304.8 67.03 0)
    (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left top))
    (uuid 2daac2a3-7809-5d12-bb51-5a3cbf1ba011)
  )
  (text "CHECKS (calculated, spec)" (at 304.8 76.33 0)
    (effects (font (size 1.8 1.8) bold) (justify left top))
    (uuid 75f2dbd4-ac51-514d-8fe8-977734a1bb40)
  )
  (text "- Battery sense: 8.4 V x 100/300 = 2.80 V at D2; 6.8 V cutoff -> 2.27 V. Inside the\n    ESP32-S3 ADC range at 11 dB (~0-3.1 V). Divider drain 28 uA.\n- Peak pack current: servo stall ~2.5 A at 6 V (15 W, provisional) + logic ~0.7 A at 5 V\n    (3.5 W) = 18.5 W; at 88 % efficiency 2.8 A at 7.4 V, 3.1 A at 6.8 V: at the pack's ~3\n    A continuous rating. Stalls are short, but the pack PCB may trip on a long stall near\n    empty. Measure the servo stall current.\n- Servo signal is 3.3 V PWM into a 6 V servo (no buffer, as the firmware assumes). Most\n    MG996R units accept it; bench-check the full open/close travel.\n- UBEC near empty: 6.8 V in for 6.0 V out leaves little headroom; the servo rail may sag\n    near cutoff, acceptable because the firmware stops lifts at 6.8 V." (at 304.8 81.53 0)
    (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left top))
    (uuid fc811002-0800-53a6-8495-468801158311)
  )
  (text "BEFORE THE FIRST POWER-UP" (at 304.8 108.03 0)
    (effects (font (size 1.8 1.8) bold) (justify left top))
    (uuid acb19a3c-08ff-598e-ae3c-e19d7d47a85c)
  )
  (text "1. Set U1 to 6.0 V and U2 to 5.00 V with a meter, nothing connected to their outputs.\n2. Confirm U4 is an 8.4 V CC/CV module and its charge current is <= 1 A (Tenergy limit).\n3. Check the pack voltage (7.4-8.4 V) and polarity at the connector.\n4. Power up with the servo unplugged; check D2 reads ~VBAT/3 in /status.\n5. Plug in the servo; run /setup to park it open." (at 304.8 113.23 0)
    (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left top))
    (uuid e67649a2-e8e1-5d05-8c0e-11934afe5a8a)
  )

  (sheet_instances
    (path "/" (page "1"))
  )
)
